                        "entry_id": "e1f3ca62-f2c8-3f82-9508-8945257d7ce8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "governor, mayor of an uyezd city"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7e9b23e-fd92-4d07-a1e0-ba7fac69cbf1",
                                "sense_id": "1b9c07f2-d156-3aa8-b67a-3811993a18d0",
                                "text": "Не раз бы́ло ска́зано и нике́м не оспо́рено, что, по поня́тию мно́гих ру́сских люде́й, ка́ждый городни́чий был «тре́тье лицо́ в госуда́рстве».",
                                "translation": "It has been said more than once and disputed by no one that, in the understanding of many Russian people, every mayor was “the third person of the state.”",
                                "english": "It has been said more than once and disputed by no one that, in the understanding of many Russian people, every mayor was “the third person of the state.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
